Z||000000||bigpacupacu||08-30-2001||10:33 PM||||Just want to know what fiero owners think the ideal engine for their fiero is. <BR>What would be the pro and cons of installing a supercharged V6 as oppossed to powereful V8 engine. Or maybe the stock 2.8L and 2.5L would be just fine. I prefer the faster and more powerful myself and would love to install a V8. Or would a "suped up" V6 be better? <BR>Just wondering.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.spotlife.com/users2/bigpacupacu/webalbum/pic/image009.jpg">  <BR>Steven<BR>85GT 4sp||||reg||10
